<p>The US Senate confirmed Oklahoma Republican Senator Markwayne Mullin as secretary of the Department of Homeland Security on March 23 in a 54-45 vote, giving President Trump a new cabinet official to lead the department responsible for border security and immigration enforcement. Mullin replaces Kristi Noem, whom Trump fired earlier this month after controversy over a large-scale immigration operation in Minnesota.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/GmapLKRBrrI26Nr6irRL6ToRYxWhMPDh2A8z1HhQw6DXL7TBepQinkg0_7uazLF-KrnFTxoef_UIPTyuQojFMEkF5TIGCUmDc7DalM8Qf57lqTDOIoCSMxdrfniVBSbp3Yx6-6gabMY3KlHX0S_Wz8i466UIk2cFvCmurvKfvWE0_jvzuGiompme64akcQJk2EaU2DQZ2yJn1aS_fz4VRzMmX7ilq2byp29WiuZTMRDGigSETeraoRR6j3PZSzXjSPrUx1jS0IUEIZmOww' alt='Sen. Markwayne Mullin, R-Okla., President Donald Trump&#x27;s pick for Homeland Security secretary, testifies during Senate Committee on Homeland Security and Governmental Affairs hearing, Wednesday, March 18, 2026 on Capitol Hill in Washington.' /><br /><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump administration: By choosing a sitting Republican senator for DHS, the White House signaled that it wanted a politically trusted ally in one of the cabinet posts most central to its immigration agenda. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/23/senate-markwayne-mullin-confirmed'>The Guardian</a>, <a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c98kd9x705eo'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Markwayne Mullin: Mullin backs President Trump’s hardline immigration stance, but he has also signaled that he would scale back some of the most aggressive policies. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/senate-approves-trumps-homeland-nominee-with-immigration-crackdown-under-scrutiny'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Senate opposition and skeptics: The leadership change at DHS came amid public backlash over the administration’s immigration enforcement and mass deportation operations. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/us-politics/article-senate-vote-markwayne-mullin-dhs-homeland-security-trump/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/23/senate-markwayne-mullin-confirmed'>Senate confirms Trump loyalist Markwayne Mullin as homeland security secretary</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c98kd9x705eo'>US Senate confirms Markwayne Mullin as homeland security chief</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/24/us-senate-confirms-markwayne-mullin-at-new-chief-of-us-department-of-homeland-security_6751754_4.html'>US Senate confirms Markwayne Mullin as new chief of Department of Homeland Security</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/us-politics/article-senate-vote-markwayne-mullin-dhs-homeland-security-trump/'>U.S. Senate confirms Trump’s pick Markwayne Mullin to lead Homeland Security</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/senate-approves-trumps-homeland-nominee-with-immigration-crackdown-under-scrutiny'>Senate approves Trump’s Homeland nominee Mullin with immigration crackdown under scrutiny</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>